#2504
hratkrag king halfling~
King Hratkrag~
King Hratkrag is here sitting on his throne.~
Hratkrag stands about 3.5ft tall, and seems to be quite old. He is wearing
a suit of padded leather armor, and a dark green cape. If it were not for
the legendary scepter which he holds in his hand, and the fact that he is
sitting on the throne, you would not know that you are in the present of
royalty.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
1000 S 
150 BODY_TORSO BODY_LEG|BODY_ARM|BODY_HAND 20d1000+9000 1d1+500
100000 RACE_HALFLING
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 1
   smile $n
   say Hello there my young friend.
   say if you wishes so to join us, type <Army Join [password]>
   say In the future, if you so wishes to resign, all you need is
   say to come back here and type <Army Resign [password]>
   say Just tell Nilrem "I wish to see the King." to see me.
else
   if armystatus($n) == 1
      smile $n
      say Hello there $n.
   else
      if armystatus($n) == 2
         say It is nice to see you again $n.
      endif
   endif
endif
~
|
