#2500
Le Morgue~
Nothing uncommon fo a morgue that spread throughout the reamls of the 
mortal. However, what you don't understand is that this morgue is 
overwhelmingly littered with corpses of halflings. You cannot imagine 
what have happened, only speculate that the halflings are probably losing 
the battle against the humans.~ 
