#2503
Le Arms Trading Post~
The smell of iron and coal filled this shop as you entered it. Score of 
broken armors and weapons littered the floor and the shelves that are 
found against the walls of the shop. Tinkering sound of metal hitting 
metal echo though this shop. From the sound of it, it seems that the 
smith who owns this place is venting his anger on whatever he is working on.~
