#2504
Le Supply Store~
This is the neatest shop you have come across so far, as the rest of the 
shops you have encounter in the halfling headquarter are either in very 
poor conditions or are very filty. The shelves are devoid of dust and 
items that are to be sold are properly placed in the shelves. On top of 
that, the items themselves looks sturdy and of superior quality.~
